v class=\"stat-label\">Streak</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Weekly target: 15h (0% achieved)</div>\n    <div class=\"progress-bar\"><div class=\"progress-fill\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #666; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">AI ASSESSMENT</div>\n    <div class=\"report-text\">Bhai, let's get real. You didn't even come close to your coding goals this week. 0 hours out of 15 is a big fat zero. You're behind, and it's time to step up.\n\nYou didn't accomplish anything this week, but you can start fresh. Your current streak is 1 day, so let's build on that.\n\nNext week, aim for 5 hours of coding and complete at least 2 episodes/videos. That's achievable, bro.\n\nListen, I know you can do better. Stop making excuses and put in the work. You're in Phase 1, it's time to grind. Let's get that streak going and crush those goals. No more slacking, bhai. It's time to level up.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"next-goal\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #666; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">NEXT WEEK'S MISSION</div>\n    Log 15+ hours and complete 3 more episodes\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #666; margin-top: 16px;\">Current phase: Phase 1</div>\n  <div class=\"footer\">SYSTEM.INIT · AI Roadmap Accountability</div>\n</div>\n</body></html>",
